      "takeaway": "Representation retains a particular encounter; feeling gives it personal significance, and developed individuality connects both with understanding.",
      "terms": "Representation or mental picture: a concept retaining reference to a particular percept; individualized concept: the same relation expressed in conceptual terms; experience: the connected range of particular encounters and concepts; feeling: the individual relation expressed in pleasure or displeasure; recognition: identifying either a kind or the same object again."
