      "takeaway": "Trace a deed's history, motive and means separately, then let actual feedback improve its concrete form.",
      "terms": "Technical capacity — practical ability to carry out a proposal; productive contribution — formation of new concrete ethical content; historical origin — influences and development preceding an act; determining reason — what sustains this present act."
